Take limit of both sides:

\mathbf{x}=A \mathbf{x}



\mathbf{0}=\mathbf{x}-A \mathbf{x}=I \mathbf{x}-A \mathbf{x}=(I-A) \mathbf{x}

So \mathbf{x} is in the null space of I-A.




